<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>We have your AlignTraits pilot request</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:24px;background:#f2f5f9;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#002650;">
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dbe4ee;border-radius:12px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding:28px;">
        <h1 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:22px;color:#004085;">Thank you, <%= name %>.</h1>
        <p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;">We have your pilot request for <strong><%= institution %></strong>.</p>
        <p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;">Someone from AlignTraits will reply within two working days to agree the scope: which class or programme, how many students and how long.</p>
        <p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;">There is no obligation. After the pilot, we share what we measured and how, and you decide whether to continue.</p>
        <p style="margin:24px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;">The AlignTraits team</p>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  <p style="max-width:600px;margin:14px auto 0;font-size:12px;color:#33669d;text-align:center;">You are getting this email because you requested a pilot on aligntraits.com.</p>
</body>
</html>
